p('Bootstrap: 2,000 video-level resamples of the fixed test predictions, seed 44. Intervals are conditional on the trained model and holdout and do not account for campaign dependence, data selection or split variability. Three additional neural initializations probe seed sensitivity; the primary seed 42 is not replaced based on test performance.')
